    {
      "name": "search_nodes",
      "description": "Find entities. Every whitespace-separated term must appear in the name, type, an observation, or the type of a relation touching the entity (case-insensitive). Returns a ranked list of names with counts and matching snippets, at most 'limit' (default 10); use open_nodes for full entities.",
